@startuml
' Source Use Case: UC-019 — View Wardrobe Coverage
' Primary Specification: ../use-cases/UC-019-view-wardrobe-coverage.md
' Supporting Authorities: ../SRS.md (v0.3); ../business-rules.md (v0.1.2)
' Business/Product: ../../01-business/BRD.md (v0.3); ../../02-product/PRD.md (v0.2)
' Master Actors/Scope: ../use-cases/use-case-diagram.puml
' Process Authority: ../../../Initial files/CapsuleAI_Scrum_Development_Workflow.md, Sections 11, 39–42, 46
' Version: 0.1; Status: Baseline Draft
' SRS trace: FR-ANL-008, FR-ANL-010, FR-ANL-011, FR-ANL-012, FR-ANL-013, FR-ANL-015, ERR-ANL-001, ERR-ANL-002, ERR-WEATHER-001
' Rule trace: BRULE-AUTH-001, BRULE-COV-001, BRULE-COV-002, BRULE-COV-003, BRULE-COV-004, BRULE-COV-005, BRULE-COV-006, BRULE-OUT-006
' Flow coverage: UC Sections 6–10; alternatives and failures retain their textual meaning.
' The textual Use Case Specification remains the normative behavioral source.

title AD-019 - View Wardrobe Coverage
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

|User|
start
:Request Personalized Everyday Capsule coverage;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Authorized wardrobe/profile access usable?) then (Yes)
    :Identify authorized current assessment context;
else (No)
    :Pause protected use; require renewed access (UC-002);
    stop
endif
repeat
    :Prepare confirmed eligible wardrobe, common priorities,
mapped occasions, style and available environment;
    :Disclose unavailable environmental context;
    note right
      Consume UC-006 currentness and bounded fallback.
      Missing weather permits reduced-context assessment
      only when remaining evidence is defensible.
    end note
    if (Relevant prior assessment basis changed?) then (Yes)
        :Mark prior Coverage Outdated until refreshed;
    endif
    if (Sufficient data for numeric Coverage?) then (Yes)
        :Evaluate positive-priority needs with hard-valid outfits;
        :Count unique garment-identity combinations per need;
        :Compute per-need coverage and priority-weighted score;
        note right
          Zero-priority needs are excluded.
          Counts are not the small displayed daily outfit subset.
        end note
        if (Assessment/result available?) then (Yes)
            if (Evaluated basis still current?) then (Yes)
                if (Valid support for relevant needs is zero?) then (Yes)
                    :Present defensible evaluated 0% with reasons;
                else (No)
                    :Present weighted Coverage and per-need evidence;
                endif
                :Explain positive priorities, context and limitations;
                |User|
                :Inspect covered or underserved need;
                |CapsuleAI|
                :Explain supported next actions without compulsory purchase;
                if (All relevant needs covered?) then (Yes)
                    :Explain no important gap established;
                endif
            else (Changed)
                :Mark assessment Outdated; withhold current score;
            endif
        else (Unavailable)
            :Explain unavailable Coverage;
            :Keep any prior Outdated status distinct;
        endif
    else (Insufficient)
        :Explain missing priorities, ready roles or required inputs;
        :Show Insufficient Information; withhold numeric 0%;
        note right
          Numeric score needs a positive priority and ready
          TOP, BOTTOM and FOOTWEAR; OUTERWEAR only if required.
        end note
    endif
    |User|
    :Review result/limitations or revise existing inputs;
repeat while (Request again after revision/recovery?) is (Yes) not (No)
|CapsuleAI|
:Finish with stated current or limited assessment outcome;
stop

@enduml
